note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note apps/omega-fhe/gate_fhe.om
note Pure Seeded-OM-2 Verification Gate for Wave 5 omega-fhe (Ring-LWE / Leveled BFV).
note
note Compose after:
note   si/directives/om2.om
note   seed/ng/sha256.om
note   protocol/omnet/om/sha512/sha512.om
note   protocol/omnet/om/ed25519/ed25519.om
note   protocol/uor-gpu/ed_sign.om
note
note Usage:
note   gate_fhe OMC_BIN REPO_ROOT SCRATCH_DIR
note   gate_fhe --bins FHE_RLWE_BIN FHE_CHECK_BIN SCRATCH_DIR
note
note Checks:
note   - Pinned omc SHA-256 verification against seed/out/omc.sha256 (mismatch => exit 69)
note   - 2x deterministic Spark omc compilation of fhe_rlwe and fhe_check (zero stderr, cmp -s)
note   - Static ELF header inspection (AArch64 e_machine=183, zero PT_DYNAMIC segment)
note   - Positive suite: selftest, audit-blind, keygen/encrypt/eval-poly/verify-ct/decrypt/inspect, depth-2 mul
note   - 15 adversarial negative controls (raw & validly-signed non-canonical >= q, wrong sk,
note     raw & validly-signed rk tamper, depth-3 & forged noise budget exceeded,
note     OMFHE1 magic/version/domain/SHA-256/Ed25519/truncation/trailing bytes, sk-as-evk)
note   - 5 live omc-recompiled source mutants (eval-poly +d drop, inv-NTT untwist drop,
note     rk0 drop, mul-noise bypass, canon < q bypass)
note
note Zero C, zero Python, zero Rust, zero gcc, zero floats, zero GPU device writes (hw_writes=0).

